WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
I've always known you were no good, yet I still find myself clinging to him.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:08.500
A good path also heeds his spirit, and even knowing it to be false, still...

3
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:14.500
I love you, let's do this together. I know, I heard that your friends said you wouldn't.

4
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:21.500
You and I are alike, I can tell. I see you as a lifelong future for myself.

5
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:30.000
Both of us, without hesitation, uncontrollably, without even waiting for the good parts of our own hearts, do it with our hearts.

6
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.000
No one cherishes me, and no one likes me.

7
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.000
I never once needed to learn from him.

8
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:41.000
However, you must understand what I know.

